Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libopencv-core4.6, libopencv-imgproc4.6, libopencv-imgcodecs4.6, libjpeg8, libpng16-16, libtiff5, libwebp7, libopenjp2-7, zlib1g, libzstd1, liblzma5
Description: High-performance image processing CLI tool
 Pixon is a fast image processing library supporting resize, rotate, crop, blur,
 sharpen, flip, flop, composite, coloradjust, alpha operations, extend, and trim.

